From: anyingiit <49945850+anyingiit@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 1 Oct 2026 21:42:04 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(init): detect a Vinext app as Vite, not Next.js

Vinext depends on `next` for the API surface but builds through Vite and
never evaluates next.config, so wiring withReticle there left the app
unconnected. FrameworkSignals gains `depsUnless`; Next declares
`vinext`, so such a project falls through to the Vite branch.

Closes #1276

Signed-off-by: anyingiit <49945850+anyingiit@users.noreply.github.com>
---
